{
  "title": "formatIngredient duplicated across four iOS files",
  "description": "Four near-identical copies of the \"amount unit (alt1, alt2) \
item\" formatter: `Ramekin/RecipeDetailViewVersioning.swift:272`, \
`Ramekin/AddToShoppingListSheet.swift:125`, \
`Ramekin/RecipeVersionSupport.swift:94`, and a sibling `formatIngredients` in \
`Ramekin/EnrichPreviewSheet.swift:139`. They diverge on whether they append \
`(note)` and whether they include alt measurements. Extract one canonical \
`Ingredient.formatted(includeAlternatives:includeNote:)` (on `Ingredient` or a \
dedicated `IngredientFormatter`) and kill the copies. Today a formatting fix \
has to be applied in four places and usually misses one.",
